\"157\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8.6pt; COLOR: #008000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">2010.4.23(금)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"107\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8.6pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">시험결과 발표</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"179\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">원스톱서비스 조회</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"128\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">2. 졸업종합시험 일반 계획</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">가. 졸업종합시험 : 해당 전공분야의 학식과 능력을 종합평가하기 위하여 종합시험을 실시한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 응시자격&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;1) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> : 3학기 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"></span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">2) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">교육</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">대학원 석사과정 무논문 신청자</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> : 5학기 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">산업대학원 석사과정 무논문 신청자</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> : 6학기 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 시험과목 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 석사과정의 종합시험 과목은 주임교수가 지정하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">3과목</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 박사과정의 종합시험 과목은 주임교수가 지정하는</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"> 4과목</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 시험과목은 교수 1인당&nbsp; 2과목 이내로 출제하여야 한다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 55.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -55.4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">※ 졸업종합시험 응시과목은 학차에 따라 한 과목씩 따로 응시할 수 없으며, </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 55.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -55.4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;석사 3과목 이상, 박사 4과목 이상 해당과목을 일괄적으로 응시하여야 함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">(단, 응시과목 중 불합격한 과목에 대해서는 한 과목 응시 가능함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 시험방법 : 대학원(석․박사) 1반, 산업(교육)대학원 1반으로 편성하여 실시한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 시험시간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;1) 석사과정 : 19:00 ~ 21:30</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 박사과정 : 19:00 ~ 22:20</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">3. 합격기준 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">대학원, 산업대학원 및 교육대학원 논문과정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 29.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 과목당 100점 만점에 석사과정은 60점 이상, 박사과정은 70점 이상인 경우 합격으로 인정하며 과목별 합격도 인정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2)</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">산업 및 교육대학원 무논문과정</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">과목당 100점 만점에 70점 이상인 경우 합격으로 인정하며 과목별 합격도 인정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">2010. 4.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">금오공과대학교 대학원(산업 및 교육대학원)장</span></p>\n&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->\n<p><!--StartFragment--></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
